{"seq":2,"slug":"binding-force-scope-legal-effect","title":"约束力范围与法律效力模型：对海关、申请人与第三方的效力边界及失效时点","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/ruling-regime-legal-model/binding-force-scope-legal-effect","wordCount":3047,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"约束力范围与法律效力模型-对海关-申请人与第三方的效力边界及失效时点\">约束力范围与法律效力模型：对海关、申请人与第三方的效力边界及失效时点</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念-约束力不是布尔值\">核心概念：约束力不是布尔值</h2><p>把预裁定（advance ruling）的约束力理解成「有效/无效」二值，是跨境合规系统建模时最先出事的地方。真实制度里，同一份裁定对<strong>不同主体</strong>的效力强度不同，在<strong>不同时点</strong>的效力状态也不同。美国 CBP 的裁定书「对全体海关人员具有约束力，直至被修改或撤销」（19 CFR §177.9：binding on all Customs Service personnel ... until modified or revoked），但它对非受送达人几乎不产生依赖保护；WTO《贸易便利化协定》第 3 条只要求成员国在<strong>对申请人</strong>关系上受约束，是否同时约束申请人则交由成员国自选（&quot;the ruling shall be binding on the Member ... the Member may also make it binding on the applicant&quot;）；中国海关预裁定同样定有效期 3 年、双向约束，并在所依据的事实或法律变化时可予撤销（海关总署令第 236 号，2018-02-01 施行）。</p>\n<p>三套制度在「有期限、可撤销」上收敛，差别在公示程序与溯及力规则。<strong>约束力是一个以「主体」和「时间」为两轴的矩阵，而非标量。</strong> 工程上必须拆成四个可判定问题——对海关有多强、对持有人有几分可选择性、对第三人是否波及、在哪个时刻起失效。它与裁定的<strong>事项与管辖范围</strong>互补：后者决定裁定「管什么」，前者决定它「管到谁、管多久」（见 <a href=\"ruling-types-jurisdiction-scope\">1_ruling-types-jurisdiction-scope.md</a>）。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>主体</th>\n<th>效力来源（示例）</th>\n<th>强度</th>\n<th>可依赖性</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>签发机关（海关）</td>\n<td>19 CFR §177.9：约束全体海关人员，直至修改或撤销</td>\n<td>最强</td>\n<td>全国统一适用，但现场须先核验事实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>裁定持有人</td>\n<td>WTO TFA 第 3.5 条：可（may）约束申请人</td>\n<td>中（成员国可选）</td>\n<td>可选择不用，但依裁定申报即锁定事实</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>同法域其他关区</td>\n<td>19 CFR §177.9；欧盟 BTI 覆盖全成员国海关</td>\n<td>强（对机关）</td>\n<td>不自动适用于该关区的具体交易</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>无关联第三方</td>\n<td>19 CFR §177.9：修改/撤销一般不另行通知</td>\n<td>最弱</td>\n<td>&quot;no other person should rely on the ruling letter&quot;</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矩阵最易忽视的是最后一行：CBP 明确提示<strong>除受送达人外，其他人不应依赖该裁定</strong>，除非走了 §177.12 的公告程序。「我查到一份别人拿到的、看起来适用的裁定」并不构成法律依赖——这正是自动化归类系统绝不能拿公开裁定库当「可直接继承的结论」的原因。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[申请人提交完整书面请求] --&gt; B{海关受理}&#10;    B --&gt;|拒绝| B1[书面通知事实与理由&lt;br/&gt;TFA 3.1]&#10;    B --&gt;|出具| C[裁定生效&lt;br/&gt;US: 签发日;EU: 通知收讫日]&#10;    C --&gt; D[对海关: 全国/全成员国约束&lt;br/&gt;直至修改或撤销]&#10;    C --&gt; E[对持有人: 可选择适用&lt;br/&gt;非转让]&#10;    C --&gt; F[对第三方: 一般不产生依赖&lt;br/&gt;除公告程序]&#10;    D --&gt; G{是否失效?}&#10;    G --&gt;|撤销 revocation| H[前瞻失效&lt;br/&gt;通常不溯及]&#10;    G --&gt;|废止 annulment| I[溯及失效&lt;br/&gt;自始无效]&#10;    G --&gt;|有效期届满| J[约定期间届满失效&lt;br/&gt;EU BTI 3 年]&#10;    H --&gt; K[重新判定 redetermination]&#10;    I --&gt; K&#10;    J --&gt; K\">flowchart TD\n    A[申请人提交完整书面请求] --&gt; B{海关受理}\n    B --&gt;|拒绝| B1[书面通知事实与理由&lt;br/&gt;TFA 3.1]\n    B --&gt;|出具| C[裁定生效&lt;br/&gt;US: 签发日;EU: 通知收讫日]\n    C --&gt; D[对海关: 全国/全成员国约束&lt;br/&gt;直至修改或撤销]\n    C --&gt; E[对持有人: 可选择适用&lt;br/&gt;非转让]\n    C --&gt; F[对第三方: 一般不产生依赖&lt;br/&gt;除公告程序]\n    D --&gt; G{是否失效?}\n    G --&gt;|撤销 revocation| H[前瞻失效&lt;br/&gt;通常不溯及]\n    G --&gt;|废止 annulment| I[溯及失效&lt;br/&gt;自始无效]\n    G --&gt;|有效期届满| J[约定期间届满失效&lt;br/&gt;EU BTI 3 年]\n    H --&gt; K[重新判定 redetermination]\n    I --&gt; K\n    J --&gt; K</pre><h2 id=\"对海关的效力-全国统一-但-事实核验-是前置条件\">对海关的效力：全国统一，但「事实核验」是前置条件</h2><p>「约束全体海关人员」听起来是绝对义务，实际有一个常被忽略的前置条件：<strong>现场关区必须先核验事实</strong>。19 CFR §177.9(b) 要求关区把裁定所述事实与实际交易比对、确认裁定条件全部满足，然后才适用该裁定；裁定的签发本身建立在「申请人提供的信息在一切实质方面准确完整」的假定之上。分类裁定的适用面还更窄——只适用于与提交样品一致或与裁定描述相符的货物。</p>\n<p>对系统的含义是：<strong>裁定不能被实现为「一票通过的免检令牌」</strong>，而应实现为一份「带前提条件的可适用结论」。把裁定的适用条件（商品描述、构成、用途、样品特征）显式建模为断言集合，报关时逐条求值，全部满足才把结论注入申报行。</p>\n<p>欧盟方向的强度更集中：一份 BTI（Binding Tariff Information）对<strong>所有成员国海关</strong>具有约束力，但只对<strong>获得它的那个法律实体</strong>有效（&quot;legally binding on all EU Customs administrations but only to the legal entity for which it was issued&quot;，Flexport 术语条目）。「对机关强、对主体窄」的组合与美国的模式同构。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对申请人的效力-可选择性-非转让性与-事实锁定\">对申请人的效力：可选择性、非转让性与「事实锁定」</h2><p>WTO TFA 第 3.5 条用了 &quot;may&quot;——成员国<strong>可以</strong>让裁定约束申请人。有的法域把它做成对申请人的义务（必须按裁定申报），有的做成权利（可不用，回到一般归类规则主张）。无论哪种，<strong>非转让性是共同底线</strong>：英国税务海关总署的 BTI 指南明确「decisions are non-transferable」，欧盟 BTI 只对签发给的那个法律实体生效。裁定不能在集团内共享、不能随业务转让、不能给同一实体的不同进口人复用；系统若按「集团 ID」匹配裁定，就会在跨境卖家常用的多法人结构下产生静默超范围适用。</p>\n<p>同时要注意「事实锁定」效应：申请人一旦依某裁定申报，就等于承诺「本交易符合裁定所述事实」。若事后发现当初请求所依据的信息不完整或失实，TFA 第 3.4 条允许撤销/变更/无效并<strong>溯及既往</strong>。设裁定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 生效、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 被溯及撤销，其效力区间被回写成空集 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0,\\ t_r) \\to \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>——这不是「从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 起失效」，而是「发生过的一切申报都失去裁定支撑」。因此系统必须持久化每份裁定所依赖的<strong>事实快照</strong>（facts snapshot），否则事后无法证明「当时的信息是完整的」，也就无法对抗溯及撤销。</p>\n<h2 id=\"对第三方的效力-只有走公告程序才产生波及\">对第三方的效力：只有走公告程序才产生波及</h2><p>默认状态下，一份裁定的修改或撤销<strong>不通知受送达人以外的任何主体</strong>（19 CFR §177.9：a ruling letter is subject to modification or revocation by CBP without notice to anyone except the person addressed），并明文提示他人不应依赖。让它波及第三方，必须进入公告程序：<strong>19 U.S.C. §1625(c)</strong> 规定，拟修改或撤销一份已生效<strong>满 60 天</strong>的解释性裁定、或改变对<strong>实质相同交易</strong>此前处理方式的，须在《海关公报》公告，利害关系人至少有 <strong>30 天</strong>评论期，最终裁定在评论期结束后 <strong>30 天内</strong>发布，并自发布之日起 <strong>60 天后生效</strong>；而 <strong>19 CFR §177.12(b)</strong> 规定生效不足 60 天的，只需<strong>直接书面通知</strong>受影响人即可，无需公告。</p>\n<p>真正把第三方拉进来的是「<strong>实质相同交易</strong>」（substantially identical transactions）。§177.12(c) 规定：主张此前已被一致处理的一方，必须证明存在负责官员的实际判定，且在此前<strong>两年</strong>内海关在全国范围内<strong>一贯地</strong>适用该判定（以清关、和解为证），举证责任在主张方。</p>\n<p>这里有一处极易踩空的点：生效日不是「签发日」，而是「<strong>公告发布日 + 60 天</strong>」，且<strong>只对尚未终局清关的报关</strong>适用（§177.12(e)：provided that liquidation of the entry in question has not become final）。同一份裁定修改，对 A 港口月内到港的货适用、对 B 已终局清关的货不适用；把裁定状态建模成全局单值，一笔业务就会同时面对两个正确答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效时点-撤销与废止的法理分野\">失效时点Ⅰ：撤销与废止的法理分野</h2><p>同样是「裁定失效」，撤销和废止的法律性质不同，直接决定溯及力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>撤销（revocation / 撤回）</strong>：裁定作出时本无不妥，因<strong>嗣后的法律、事实或情势变化</strong>而不再成立，自公告生效日起<strong>前瞻适用</strong>（欧盟 BTI 同样以向前失效为原则）。</li>\n<li><strong>废止 / 无效（annulment / invalidation）</strong>：裁定<strong>自始不符合</strong>法律或其解释，或基于不完整、虚假、误导性信息作出，效果是<strong>溯及既往</strong>，即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mi>r</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∅</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[t_0, t_r) \\to \\varnothing</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6633em;vertical-align:-0.0817em;\"></span><span class=\"mord amsrm\">∅</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>修改（modification）</strong>：裁定仍有效但部分内容（如编码附注、适用条件）被调整，产生新版本并以 supersedes 衔接旧版，原效力区间内已据其申报的货物不因修改而自动丧失依据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>判断二者是<strong>原因导向而非结果导向</strong>的：决定溯及力的不是「海关损失了多少钱」，而是「瑕疵发生在裁定作出之时，还是在此之后」。设裁定所依据的法律与事实集合为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span>，在时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6151em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span> 的实况为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，若瑕疵存在于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7651em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（即 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F(t_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 本身有误或不合法）则为废止，否则为撤销：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>retroactive</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 不完整/失实/不合法</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">;</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>prospective</mtext><mtext>  </mtext><mo>⟺</mo><mtext>  </mtext><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 合法</mtext><mo>∧</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>t</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>F</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>t</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{retroactive} \\iff F(t_0)\\ \\text{不完整/失实/不合法};\\qquad\n\\text{prospective} \\iff F(t_0)\\ \\text{合法} \\wedge F(t) \\neq F(t_0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6919em;vertical-align:-0.024em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">retroactive</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不完整</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">失实</span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">不合法</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">prospective</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">⟺</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">合法</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∧</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mrel\"><span class=\"mord vbox\"><span class=\"thinbox\"><span class=\"rlap\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"inner\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mrel\"></span></span></span><span class=\"fix\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace nobreak\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>欧盟制度还叠加了一条：BTI 的一般有效期是<strong>三年</strong>（Regulation (EU) No 952/2013 第 33 条；实务条目亦记为 &quot;generally valid for 3 years&quot;）。这与美国模式形成对照——美国 UCC 一般决定「原则上无限期有效」（UCC 第 22 条：the decision shall be valid without limitation of time），而<strong>约束性信息决定是明确的例外</strong>，第 24 条授权委员会规定「决定并非无限期有效」的情形。BTI 三年到期即失效，不待撤销；到期后继续使用构成无裁定申报。</p>\n<h2 id=\"失效时点-有效期-依赖保护与可适用上界\">失效时点Ⅱ：有效期、依赖保护与可适用上界</h2><p>把上述规则收拢成一个可计算的失效时点模型。给定裁定 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的生效时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>e</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">e</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span></span></span></span></span>、约定有效期 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>T</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span></span>、撤销公告发布时刻 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>p</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">p</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span></span></span></span></span>、公告生效延迟 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span></span></span>（美国 §1625(c) 情形下 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>L</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">L = 60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 天），则 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">r</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span></span></span></span></span> 的<strong>可适用上界</strong>为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>r</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mtext> ⁣</mtext><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">(</mo><mi>e</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>T</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>p</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>L</mi><mo fence=\"false\" stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"1.2em\" maxsize=\"1.2em\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t_{\\text{last}}(r) = \\min\\!\\big(e + T,\\ p + L\\big)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">r</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:-0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">(</span></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2em;vertical-align:-0.35em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"delimsizing size1\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>并且只在满足「清关未终局」这一谓词的报关上生效。<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 的意义在于：有效期届满与撤销生效<strong>谁先到谁生效</strong>，互不豁免。系统需要对每份裁定同时维护 <code>expires_at</code> 与 <code>revoked_effective_at</code> 两个字段而非单一 <code>status</code>：前者对应约定期间届满（BTI 3 年），前瞻失效；后者对应嗣后变化触发的撤销，同样前瞻并可在公告后及于实质相同交易；废止则用 <code>annulled_from</code> 指向自始无效那一刻，触发全区间重新判定。</p>\n<p>欧盟的撤销还有一个对持有人友好的细节：当撤销源于法律变化时，通常给予一个<strong>过渡使用期</strong>（依原 BTI 覆盖的货物在一定期限内仍可继续办理），这是「依赖保护」（protection of legitimate expectations）原则的落地。工程上这意味着裁定的「可适用」状态需要区分<strong>对机关已失效</strong>与<strong>对持有人仍有过渡期</strong>——两个区间不同步，不能共用一个失效时刻。</p>\n<h2 id=\"工程落地-判定顺序与状态机契约\">工程落地：判定顺序与状态机契约</h2><p>把法理模型收束成两个可测试的函数：<code>applicability(ruling, entity, port, entry, as_of) -&gt; verdict</code> 回答「这份裁定此刻对这笔业务是否可适用」，<code>effect_of_invalidation(ruling, cause) -&gt; retroactive?</code> 回答「这次失效是否溯及」。前者用于报关入口，后者用于重新判定批次。</p>\n<p>判定顺序不可颠倒——<strong>先主体、再时点、后事实</strong>。先主体：裁定是否签发给该法律实体（非转让性）；再时点：<code>as_of</code> 是否落在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>e</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><msub><mi>t</mi><mtext>last</mtext></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[e,\\ t_{\\text{last}})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">last</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 内且清关未终局；后事实：商品断言是否全部满足。顺序颠倒会导致用 A 法域的裁定去判定 B 实体，或在已终局清关上套用新规则，这类错误静默且难追。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>自检清单：约束力是否按「主体 × 时点」矩阵而非布尔值建模？对海关适用前是否强制事实核验？是否按法律实体而非集团匹配（非转让性）？第三方波及是否只在公告程序下发生？撤销与废止是否分开处理溯及力（原因导向）？有效期届满与撤销生效是否取 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\min</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span></span> 而非互相覆盖？每份裁定是否持久化了事实快照以对抗溯及撤销？这七问对任何法域的预裁定约束力引擎都成立——它决定了后续「重新判定」「差额追补」「过渡期管理」有没有正确的法律地基。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"约束力范围与法律效力模型：对海关、申请人与第三方的效力边界及失效时点","id":"约束力范围与法律效力模型-对海关-申请人与第三方的效力边界及失效时点"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：约束力不是布尔值","id":"核心概念-约束力不是布尔值"},{"level":2,"text":"对海关的效力：全国统一，但「事实核验」是前置条件","id":"对海关的效力-全国统一-但-事实核验-是前置条件"},{"level":2,"text":"对申请人的效力：可选择性、非转让性与「事实锁定」","id":"对申请人的效力-可选择性-非转让性与-事实锁定"},{"level":2,"text":"对第三方的效力：只有走公告程序才产生波及","id":"对第三方的效力-只有走公告程序才产生波及"},{"level":2,"text":"失效时点Ⅰ：撤销与废止的法理分野","id":"失效时点-撤销与废止的法理分野"},{"level":2,"text":"失效时点Ⅱ：有效期、依赖保护与可适用上界","id":"失效时点-有效期-依赖保护与可适用上界"},{"level":2,"text":"工程落地：判定顺序与状态机契约","id":"工程落地-判定顺序与状态机契约"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"预裁定制度类型与管辖范围：中国海关预裁定、美国 CBP ruling 与欧盟 BTI 对照","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/ruling-regime-legal-model/ruling-types-jurisdiction-scope"},"next":{"title":"归类裁定的法律基础：HS 协调制度、GIR 解释规则与国内归类决定的推导链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/advance-tariff-ruling-binding-classification/ruling-regime-legal-model/classification-legal-basis-gir"}}